# Review docs

When you change review verdicts, tag exclusivity, icon precedence, leftover-tag Alert behavior, or `set-good` / `set-harmful` tag payloads, update [`docs/review.md`](docs/review.md) in the same change.

That page is the human map of Looks OK / Needs a look and of tags on harmful.
